# Files pinned by sha256 and size in src-tauri/engine.json: git must check
# them out byte for byte on every platform. With core.autocrlf (the Windows
# runner's default) the licence came out CRLF, 1,099 bytes against its
# 1,078-byte pin, and v0.3.56's Windows build stopped at "Fetch the AI engine".
src-tauri/engine-licenses/** -text
